// Two-line exchanges for street vendors. The first line is the player's, the second the character's; each knot is one exchange.

=== greeting ===
What is good today? # who:player
Everything is good, the prices are even better.
-> END

=== smalltalk ===
How is business? # who:player
Slow in the fog, loud in the sun.
-> END

=== busy ===
Got a minute? # who:player
Customers first. Give me a moment.
-> END

=== deflect ===
Heard anything about the late shipments? # who:player
I sell what I sell. Ask the distributor.
-> END

=== farewell ===
See you later. # who:player
Come back hungry.
-> END
